poke 0 31415992
poke 1 2
Loop:
yield
get r0 db 20
beq r0 1 Profile
beq r0 2 SelectWait
beq r0 3 ExecWait
get r15 db 8
get r0 db 9
beq r15 r0 Loop
poke 10 2
poke 11 0
